{"baseline":{"amendments":[],"id":"lightweight-equipment-bracket-03-basis","requirements":[{"id":"BRACKET03-GEOMETRY","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/dimensions.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"5e287f388692857a92b6eecbb5438c403d44434439cb83b15fc8b1e34b3c511c"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/context.md","locator":"Baseline geometry","sha256":"225c7148f7913495c5d0ba726b8bf2c617ff9ecbc56aee03c58133683db85363"}],"text":"Baseline and revision preserve base, cheeks, complete crossbar outside faces, four Ø6.6 base holes, two Ø8.2 pivot holes, Ø24 pivot annuli and the empty service-access box."},{"id":"BRACKET03-MANUFACTURING","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/context.md","locator":"Customer and manufacturing capability","sha256":"225c7148f7913495c5d0ba726b8bf2c617ff9ecbc56aee03c58133683db85363"}],"text":"The lighter single-billet two-setup design respects 8 mm tool diameter, 4 mm internal radius/wall and 6 mm bore-edge-to-outside distance without additive or welded substitution."},{"id":"BRACKET03-LOAD","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/load-case.csv","locator":"row:cable_snag","sha256":"49f86d6d57e9bde4c2109a455e88fb9349e008b23e5719d84a8a0a7839654f12"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/context.md","locator":"Mechanics and design target","sha256":"225c7148f7913495c5d0ba726b8bf2c617ff9ecbc56aee03c58133683db85363"}],"text":"Both revisions use exactly +Y 100 N distributed over x=-20..20,y=-22,z=74..86 and cylindrical restraint on all four base holes, retaining the resulting torsion."},{"id":"BRACKET03-MATERIAL","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/context.md","locator":"Material and analysis basis","sha256":"225c7148f7913495c5d0ba726b8bf2c617ff9ecbc56aee03c58133683db85363"}],"text":"Both solves use homogeneous linear-elastic material E=69 GPa, ν=0.33 and density 2700 kg/m³."},{"id":"BRACKET03-RESPONSES","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/load-case.csv","locator":"deflection_limit_mm,stress_limit_MPa","sha256":"49f86d6d57e9bde4c2109a455e88fb9349e008b23e5719d84a8a0a7839654f12"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/context.md","locator":"Mechanics and design target; Material and analysis basis","sha256":"225c7148f7913495c5d0ba726b8bf2c617ff9ecbc56aee03c58133683db85363"}],"text":"Crossbar-centroid displacement including torsion is at most 0.50 mm and evaluated stress at most 120 MPa under a declared non-singular region while retaining full fields."},{"id":"BRACKET03-REACTIONS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/lightweight-equipment-bracket/03-dock-sensor-yoke/context.md","locator":"Mechanics and design target; Material and analysis basis","sha256":"225c7148f7913495c5d0ba726b8bf2c617ff9ecbc56aee03c58133683db85363"}],"text":"Support reactions balance the sideways force and twisting moment and identify the base-hole bearing simplification."},{"id":"BRACKET03-REFINEMENT","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workf